      "id": "s1",
      "nodeId": "n3",
      "text": "In the November/December 2009 issue of the *World Watch* journal, Goodland and co-author Jeff Anhang published the shocking estimate of \"at least 51%\" of global greenhouse gas emissions attributable to the lifecycle and supply chain of livestock products (meaning all meats, dairy, and by-products).",
      "contextBefore": "ronmental conservation. He is the co-author of *Amazon Jungle-Green Hell to Red Desert?: An Ecological Discussion of the Environmental Impact of the Highway Construction Program in the Amazon Basin*. ",
      "contextAfter": " PROGRAM TRANSCRIPTION CH: This is Robert Goodland. He is retired as the lead Environmental Advisor at the World Bank group and he served there for 23 years. In 2008 he was awarded the IUCN's first Co",
      "start": 604,
      "end": 903,
      "extractSha256": "adfbf5a2bad84d6af25b5a33fad6cc1340c7f33eb68b6223cc227a5865b56960",
      "windowSha256": "a26152c15c358b559e6f82372c2dd06afb7e95a6279fdc311957feaf60857c94",
      "fetchedAt": "2026-11-17T23:18:10.195Z",
      "waybackUrl": "https://web.archive.org/web/20150829005126/https://responsibleeatingandliving.com/favorites/robert-goodland-interview",
      "tier": "exact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "nodeId": "n4",
      "text": "A more recent and comprehensive study published by Worldwatch Institute, however, finds that livestock and their byproducts actually account for 51% of worldwide human-related greenhouse gas emissions annually.",
      "contextBefore": "ilable for grazing. [[2]](#_ftnref2) Henning Steinfeld et al., FAO, Livestock's Long Shadow: Environmental Issues and Options (2006), *available at* http://www.fao.org/docrep/010/a0701e/a0701e00.htm. ",
      "contextAfter": " Robert Goodland & Jeff Anhang, *Livestock and Climate Change*, World Watch Magazine, November/December 2009, at 11. [[3]](#_ftnref3) David Tilman & Michael Clark, *Global Diets Link Environmental Sus",
      "start": 12307,
      "end": 12517,
      "extractSha256": "882cfd8a1344518b8417e4381b1ed0c833a9b5631ca53174be6f05ed1d4ebe4f",
